      <title>Use Flight Groundings to Prepare for a Cyberattack on the US</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/opinion/articles/2026-11-21/use-flight-groundings-to-prepare-for-a-cyberattack-on-the-us</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">56fd7d08c6cd2d91c75244bd</guid>
      <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 13:00:17 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>In the past week, the US has seen a series of troubling computer outages: a nationwide air-traffic ground stop that snarled travel for days; a failure of some of the largest banks’ mobile apps and ATMs; and, ironically, an interruption that left the National Security Agency incapable of using its primary classified network.</description>
